@startuml
title CycleFar — Import from Garmin and link rides (ADR 0002, not yet built)

autonumber
hide footbox

actor Rider
boundary "GarminImportsController" as Controller
control "GarminConnect::\nImportActivities" as Import
control "GarminConnect::Client" as Client
control "Fit::Reader +\nRideCalculator" as Calculator
control "Ride linking" as Linker
entity "Activity" as Activity
database "PostgreSQL" as Database
collections "Active Storage\nlocal disk volume" as Storage
participant "Garmin Connect\nPersonal API" as Garmin

== Import (GAR-003 to GAR-006) ==
Rider -> Controller: POST import
alt not the GARMIN_RIDER_EMAIL rider
  Controller --> Rider: 404
end
Controller -> Database: load the rider's profile and active plan
Controller -> Import: call(profile, plan)
Import -> Database: take owner advisory lock
Import -> Import: window = plan start (first import)\nor last import − 7 days, to today
Import -> Client: new(decrypted key)
Client -> Garmin: POST personal-api-key/token (ApiKey)
alt 401/403, 429, timeout or 5xx
  Garmin --> Client: error
  Client --> Import: typed error (no key in message)
  Import --> Controller: Failed
  Controller --> Rider: calendar with guidance; nothing changed
end
Garmin --> Client: text/plain JWT (24 h), kept in memory only
loop each page until a short page
  Client -> Garmin: GET activities/search/activities\n(startDate, endDate, start, limit; Bearer)
  Garmin --> Client: summaries
end
Client --> Import: summaries mapped to sport, UTC start, local date
loop each summary
  group short transaction
    Import -> Activity: upsert by garmin_activity_id, or merge\ninto an upload starting within 60 s
    Activity -> Database: save summary fields
  end
  opt cycling and no stored file
    Import -> Client: download(activityId)
    Client -> Garmin: GET download-service/files/activity/{id}
    Garmin --> Client: zip with one .fit
    Client --> Import: .fit bytes
    Import -> Calculator: samples and figures at the FTP on the ride date\n(or the frozen completion FTP if linked)
    group short transaction
      Import -> Activity: save figures
      Activity -> Storage: store FIT file
    end
    note right: A failed download or parse keeps the\nactivity without a file; next import retries.
  end
end
group short transaction
  Import -> Database: Garmin activities in the window but not listed
  Import -> Activity: destroy Garmin-only records;\nmerged uploads lose only the Garmin id and summary
end
note right of Import
  Only after a complete listing.
  Nothing outside the window is touched.
end note
Import -> Linker: auto-link
Import -> Database: save last import time; release lock
Controller --> Rider: calendar with "Imported N, updated N, removed N"

== Link (GAR-007 to GAR-009) ==
group transaction under plan lock
  Linker -> Database: completed workouts with no link
  Linker -> Activity: link when exactly one unlinked cycling\nactivity falls on the scheduled date
  note right: Never replaces an existing link.\nTrigger: completed workout, same rider.
end
Rider -> Controller: Choose ride (picker: ±3 days, newest first)
Controller -> Linker: link(workout, activity)
group transaction under plan lock
  Linker -> Activity: unlink from any other workout, link here,\nrecalculate figures at the frozen FTP
end
Rider -> Controller: Ride found -> completion form with the ride preselected
note over Controller
  Completion stays manual: CompletionRecorder records
  RPE and quality, then links the preselected ride.
end note

note over Calculator, Storage
  Completed workouts are never written. Activities feed no weekly
  totals, load limits, feedback evaluation, proposals or statuses.
end note
@enduml
